    <h2 id="controller">1. Who is responsible for your data</h2>
    <p>
      The data controller is KOA Sports ("KOA", "we"), organiser of XHOCK at Happi Arena Cancun.
      Legal entity, registered address and privacy contact: <strong>[KOA to confirm]</strong>.
    </p>

    <h2 id="data">2. What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you open the registration form and complete a purchase, we collect:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Buyer contact data:</strong> first name, last name, email address, phone number and country.</li>
      <li><strong>Player data:</strong> for each ticket, the player's name, age, position and jersey size.</li>
      <li><strong>Campaign data:</strong> UTM parameters, advertising click identifiers (for example gclid or fbclid), the landing page and the external referrer, stored to attribute the registration to the campaign that generated it.</li>
      <li><strong>Payment data:</strong> processed directly by Stripe. KOA receives the result of the payment and limited billing details, but never your full card number.</li>
      <li><strong>Technical and analytics data:</strong> if you interact with the page, Google Tag Manager (including Google Analytics) and the Meta Pixel may set cookies and collect device, browser and interaction data.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      The form also contains a hidden anti-bot field. It is not intended to be filled in by people and is not
      used to identify you.
    </p>

    <h2 id="why">3. Why we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To process your registration, assign players to teams and prepare the event.</li>
      <li>To process the payment and send the purchase confirmation and event instructions.</li>
      <li>To answer questions and manage cancellations, transfers or incidents.</li>
      <li>To measure the performance of our advertising and improve the page.</li>
      <li>To comply with legal, accounting and tax obligations.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We do not sell your personal data. We do not use the phone number submitted in the form to send
      unsolicited marketing messages.
    </p>

    <h2 id="basis">4. Legal bases</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>[KOA to confirm]</strong> — depending on the jurisdiction, processing relies on the performance
      of the contract (registration and payment), compliance with legal obligations, legitimate interest
      (security and basic analytics) and, where required, your consent for advertising cookies. The final
      wording must be validated for Mexico (LFPDPPP) and for visitors from the United States, Canada and the
      European Union.
    </p>

    <h2 id="sharing">5. Who we share it with</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Stripe</strong>, as payment processor, for the checkout and payment confirmation.</li>
      <li><strong>Google</strong> (Tag Manager / Analytics) and <strong>Meta</strong> (Pixel), for measurement and advertising, only after you interact with the page.</li>
      <li><strong>Hosting and email providers</strong> used by KOA to operate the site and send confirmations. <strong>[KOA to confirm the exact providers.]</strong></li>
      <li>Authorities, when required by law.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="storage">6. Cookies, local storage and retention</h2>
    <p>
      The page stores two things in your browser:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Registration draft</strong> in <code>sessionStorage</code>, so you do not lose what you typed if you reload or leave the page. It expires after 24 hours and is deleted when the checkout starts successfully. It never leaves your device.</li>
      <li><strong>Campaign attribution</strong> in <code>localStorage</code> for up to 90 days, so a registration can be attributed to the ad that brought you even if you come back later.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Analytics cookies from Google and Meta are only loaded if you accept them in the cookie banner. Your choice is
      kept in <code>localStorage</code> (key <code>koa_analytics_consent</code>) and you can change it at any time from
      <strong>Cookie settings</strong> in the footer. You can also block or delete cookies in your browser settings.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Retention:</strong> registration and payment records are kept for the period required to operate
      the event and to comply with accounting and tax obligations. <strong>[KOA to confirm the exact
      period.]</strong>
    </p>

    <h2 id="rights">7. Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Subject to applicable law, you can request access to your data, its rectification or deletion, object to
      certain processing, withdraw consent for analytics, and ask for a copy of the data you provided.
    </p>
    <p>
      To exercise these rights, <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsappNumber }}?text=Hi%20KOA%2C%20I%20have%20a%20data%20privacy%20request%20about%20XHOCK" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">message KOA on WhatsApp</a>
      and state clearly which right you want to exercise. <strong>[KOA to confirm the formal privacy inbox
      and the response deadline.]</strong>
    </p>

    <h2 id="minors">8. Minors</h2>
    <p>
      Players under 18 must be registered by a parent or legal guardian, who confirms that they have the
      authority to provide the player's data and to accept the Terms &amp; Conditions on the player's behalf.
      If you believe a minor's data was submitted without authorisation, contact us so we can delete it.
    </p>

    <h2 id="security">9. Security</h2>
    <p>
      The site is served over HTTPS. Payment data is handled by Stripe. Access to registration data is
      restricted to KOA staff and providers who need it to operate the event. No system is completely secure,
      but we apply reasonable technical and organisational measures.
    </p>

    <h2 id="changes">10. Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy when the event operation or the law changes. The date at the top shows the
      latest version. Material changes will be communicated on this page.
    </p>
    <p>
      Privacy contact: <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsappNumber }}?text=Hi%20KOA%2C%20I%20have%20a%20data%20privacy%20question%20about%20XHOCK" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">KOA on WhatsApp</a>.
      Formal address: <strong>[KOA to confirm]</strong>.
    </p>
